@@ -0,0 +1,161 @@
+/* poll(2)-based ae.c module, for systems with neither event ports, epoll
+ * nor kqueue. Unlike select(2), it is not limited to FD_SETSIZE
+ * descriptors, so the event loop can hold maxclients connections.
+ *
+ * The descriptors watched are kept packed at the front of an array of
+ * struct pollfd, which poll(2) takes as it is; each descriptor's index in
+ * it is kept by descriptor, so that adding, changing and removing one
+ * takes constant time. A descriptor removed leaves its place to the last
+ * one.
+ *
